    judge). 3046 prisms measured; PhaseThresholds ride that count at the rail prism''s
    nominal volume plus a trail band. Flora and fauna: Wildlife Liberation Cell/Wildlife
    Liberation Cell Config 4''s spawn profile. Regenerate with
    Tools/Build/author_regatta_assets.py from Tools/Build/regatta_shuffle_pool.json, never
    by hand.'
